{"overview":"تایو آسنو از زمان مرگ والدینش تنهاست و تنها کسی که به‌نظر می‌رسد برای او اهمیت می‌دهد، دوست دوران کودکی و همکلاسی‌اش، موتسومی یوزاکورا است؛ اما موتسومی راز دارد—او سرپرست یک خانواده جاسوس است! و علاوه بر این، برادرش کیوئیچیرو به‌طرز خطرناکی از او محافظت می‌کند! برای جلوگیری از قتل او توسط کیوئیچیرو، تایو و موتسومی باید گامی نهایی بردارند—ازدواج! چون در خانواده یوزاکورا، خانواده نمی‌تواند خانواده‌اش را بکشند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Taiyo Asano has been on his own ever since his parents died and the only one who seems to care for him is his childhood friend and classmate, Mutsumi Yozakura. But Mutsumi has a secret—she is the head of a family of spies! And on top of that, her brother Kyoichiro is dangerously protective of her! To stop Kyoichiro from killing him, Taiyo and Mutsumi must take the ultimate leap—marriage! Because in the Yozakura family, family cannot kill family.","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":28,"y":2024,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":27,"y":2024,"poster":"/ld8DpQKpM4T1wRAiBjgReV0mQcK.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":24,"y":2026,"poster":"/7uiYNvcE66KDJIvatlcRYmD3MTj.jpg"}],"episodes":42,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"川島零士","role":"Taiyo Asano (voice)","photo":"/tJriYA3tctzKP3ZnAwsxkey9iyU.jpg","en":"Reiji Kawashima"},{"name":"کائده هوندو","role":"Mutsumi Yozakura (voice)","photo":"/11BcHnuJYrOZhIftgUiQqfm7TK6.jpg","en":"Kaede Hondo"},{"name":"کاتسویوکی کونیشی","role":"Kyoichiro Yozakura (voice)","photo":"/nYM5cH6U7cp4x9dIzW0enmEKmeV.jpg","en":"Katsuyuki Konishi"},{"name":"鬼頭明里","role":"Futaba Yozakura (voice)","photo":"/AoRQOZRC0yINB0WeKnM569rV1wF.jpg","en":"Akari Kito"},{"name":"悠木碧","role":"Shion Yozakura (voice)","photo":"/a5Mkd66GV1l3c9bZZtnvjUf33T2.jpg","en":"Aoi Yuuki"},{"name":"興津和幸","role":"Shinzo Yozakura (voice)","photo":"/vgyaK5dAxhvzAi6LJM3ZyaJd4mJ.jpg","en":"Kazuyuki Okitsu"},{"name":"内山夕実","role":"Nanao Yozakura (voice)"